# basename | reason
binary-extstore.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
binary.t | relies on eviction under a deliberately tiny cache
chunked-extstore.t | chunked remote objects are unsupported
chunked-items.t | exercises chunking plus eviction under memory pressure
dyn-maxbytes.t | configures removed slab automove and reclaim behavior
error-extstore.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
evictions.t | v2 has no eviction
extstore-buckets.t | upstream flash-extstore buckets/compaction removed
extstore-cas.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
extstore-jbod.t | v2 has one remote MR, not flash JBOD
extstore-overdel.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
extstore-start.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
extstore-tiered.t | flash tiering/compaction removed
extstore-tiered2.t | flash tiering/compaction removed
extstore.t | upstream flash-extstore options/backend removed
flush-all.t | LRU walk was removed; flush boundary is lazy/second-granularity
getset.t | large-value and cache-pressure sections require chunking/eviction
issue_14.t | asserts slab-page reclamation behavior removed in v2
issue_22.t | explicitly fills a tiny cache and expects eviction
issue_41.t | fills slab classes and expects eviction/reclaim
issue_163.t | asserts LRU object reclamation
issue_183.t | asserts LRU object reclamation
lru-crawler.t | crawler removed
lru-maintainer.t | maintainer and segmented LRU removed
lru.t | LRU commands and queues removed
maxconns.t | its extstore subtest assumes a local flash path
metaget.t | its extstore section assumes the upstream flash backend/options
restart.t | configures removed temporary_ttl and slab-maintainer behavior
slabs-cas.t | starts memcached with the removed slab_reassign option
slabs-mover.t | slab mover removed
slabs-reassign-chunked.t | slab reassignment and chunked values removed
slabs-reassign2.t | slab reassignment removed
slabs_reassign.t | slab reassignment removed
stats.t | starts with removed LRU options and asserts removed counters
strtol-testing.t | expects parsing inside the now-unsupported slabs command
watcher.t | waits for mutation/deletion events coupled to removed LRU paths
whitespace.t | scans generated/tracked build artifacts in this development tree
